But wait: for both rules to dispatch in one tick, the second rule's item must also match. rework-on-label: query pr labels [agent:rework] — the PR item needs labels ['agent:rework']. And rework-on-red-ci: notPrLabels agent:rework — the ISSUE item carries pr: {labels: [...]}. With the issue rule first: it dispatches (no runs yet), onTrigger appends run → the PR rule then probes → suppressed → capturedTriggers.length === 1. 

